    {
      "id": "5bf2bb2c-10a0-4d98-81c1-8272a6e89079",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -80,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 544,
        "height": 848,
        "content": "## Automated AI Job Scout & Resume Builder for n8n Roles\n\nThis workflow automatically hunts for remote AI and automation roles, specifically targeting the n8n, Python, and AI stack. It leverages AI to analyze job descriptions and dynamically tailor your base resume to match. It then generates a custom Google Doc, maintains a database in Google Sheets, and sends instant high-match alerts via Telegram to ensure you never miss a relevant opportunity.\n\n## How it works\n1. Search: Triggered weekly (or daily), the workflow queries the JSearch API via RapidAPI for \u201cAI workflow automation (n8n)\u201d roles with \u201cwork from home\u201d enabled.\n2. Filter: It uses an IF node to ensure \u201cn8n\u201d is explicitly mentioned in the full job description, removing irrelevant results.\n3. Analyze & Tailor: An AI Agent (powered by Groq/GPT) extracts key requirements and seamlessly rewrites your base resume to highlight exactly how your skills match the job post.\n4. Document & Notify: The tailored resume is saved as a new Google Doc. High-match roles, along with the customized resume link, are appended to a Google Sheet and sent to your Telegram bot for immediate application. \u00a0 \n\n## Setup steps\n1. API Keys: Obtain keys for RapidAPI (JSearch) and Groq Cloud.\n2. Google Workspace: Create a base resume document. Create a Google Sheet with headers: Job Title, Company, Tech Stack, Job Type, Apply Link, and Tailored Resume Link.\n3. Credentials: Add your credentials in n8n for Google Sheets, Google Docs/Drive, Telegram, and Groq.\n4. Configuration: Update the Fetch Remote Jobs node with your RapidAPI key, map your base resume to the document node, and update the Alert Telegram node with your numeric Chat ID."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
